+// ── P17 save step — the `franchises` and `cameos` roots at P17_SAVE_VERSION ──
+//
+// Authority: canonical rev02 §10 (next governed version; forward-only, root-additive; empty seeding at
+// migration; identity walks), charter r2 §"Save and independent RED design" and RED item (6); cameo
+// contract §5 (additive versioned cameo-booking authority; legacy saves migrate to empty; downgrade
+// refuses recorded bookings). Version numbers are read from the live constants and the step's symbols are
+// era-neutral (review F16), so the integrator's rebase (REPORT r2 §e) moves the constant pair and the predecessor
+// bindings only. The predecessor's own validator is still resolved by its number: it is the predecessor's symbol.
+
+import { readFileSync } from 'node:fs'
