+// release), F22 (contract-named numbers inlined). Authority: canonical rev02 f2eff635 §5.2, §5.3 ("a discount
+// through the same optional field, so it too is read at lock and at release"), §8, §9, §10 (milestones[]
+// closed versioned enum; one main continuity; a spin-off branch is a thin pointer to its SubProperty), §11
+// ("Reboot fully resets associations by key-scoping alone"; BRIDGING_DISCOUNT on parent-branch talent);
+// charter r2 lines 11, 13, 21, 31.
